<title>PAKISTAN: Burshane Pakistan net falls 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Burshane Pakistan net falls 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		     246 vs 202</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   38 vs  41</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 28 vs  33</p>
<p>    Interim div paid   35 pct vs  35 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final dividend     40 pct vs  50 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The company's full name is Burshane (Pakistan) Ltd. It distributes liquefied petroleum gas. Book closure December 9-16. AGM December 16 at Karachi. Ex-dividend date December 9.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
